      "text": "Use instead of *chairwoman* or *chairman.* Capitalize as a title before a person\u2019s name. \n\nWhen using chair as a title, remove committee: *House Ways and Means Chair Jason Smith,* not *House Ways and Means Committee Chair Jason Smith.*\n\n",
