      "text": "When referencing in a story, use **POLITICO**, sted POLITICO Pro, Pro, Pro XXXXX: *Boehner told POLITICO* sted *Boehner told POLITICO Pro* or *Boehner told Pro Health Care.* Campaign Pro is the exception.",
